        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>教育理论笔记 - 葛雷制与昆西教学法</title>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimSun\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    max-width: 800px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 20px;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .section {\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    border-bottom: 1px dashed #ccc;\n    padding-bottom: 15px;\n  }\n  .section:last-child {\n    border-bottom: none;\n  }\n  .title-line {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n  }\n  .red { color: #d32f2f; font-weight: bold; }\n  .blue { color: #1565c0; }\n  .highlight-cyan {\n    background-color: #b3e5fc;\n    padding: 1px 3px;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n  }\n  .highlight-orange {\n    background-color: #ffe0b2;\n    padding: 1px 3px;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n  }\n  .highlight-purple {\n    background-color: #e1bee7;\n    padding: 1px 3px;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n  }\n  .highlight-yellow {\n    background-color: #fff9c4;\n    padding: 1px 3px;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n  }\n  .annotation {\n    color: #d32f2f;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  .annotation-blue {\n    color: #1565c0;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  .watermark {\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #90caf9;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 15px 0;\n    opacity: 0.7;\n  }\n  .label {\n    color: #d32f2f;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .sub-label {\n    color: #d32f2f;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  ol {\n    margin: 5px 0 5px 20px;\n    padding-left: 10px;\n  }\n  ol li {\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .note-box {\n    border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n    padding: 10px 15px;\n    margin: 10px 0;\n    background: #fafafa;\n  }\n  .tag {\n    display: inline-block;\n    padding: 1px 6px;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    margin-right: 5px;\n  }\n  .tag-not-tested {\n    background: #ffcdd2;\n    color: #c62828;\n  }\n  .tag-tested {\n    background: #c8e6c9;\n    color: #2e7d32;\n  }\n  .tag-noun {\n    background: #bbdefb;\n    color: #1565c0;\n  }\n  .handwritten-red {\n    color: #d32f2f;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", cursive;\n  }\n  .handwritten-blue {\n    color: #1565c0;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", cursive;\n  }\n  .indent {\n    margin-left: 20px;\n  }\n  .circle-annotation {\n    border: 2px solid #d32f2f;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    padding: 0 4px;\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"title-line\">\n    <span class=\"red\">葛雷制</span>\n    <span class=\"tag tag-not-tested\">没考过</span>\n    <span class=\"handwritten-red\">口诀：检内衣（简介、内容、意义）</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"note-box\">\n    <span class=\"label\">简介：</span>葛雷制又称\"双校制\"、\"二部制\"。是美国教育家沃特在葛雷市所推行的一种教学制度。\n    <span class=\"annotation-blue\">（学校分为工商学校）</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"note-box\">\n    <span class=\"label\">内容：</span>以杜威的教育思想为理论基础，把学校分为四个部分：<span class=\"highlight-cyan\">工</span>和商店、教室、礼堂、<span class=\"highlight-cyan\">体育</span>运动场；课程也分为四个方面：<span class=\"highlight-cyan\">家政</span>和<span class=\"highlight-cyan\">工艺</span>、团体活动、<span class=\"highlight-cyan\">科学</span>。为了减少经费，将全校学生一分为二，一部分在教室上课，一部分在其他场所活动，上下午对调。\n    <span class=\"annotation-blue\">（课程分为\"加工团体法\"）</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"note-box\">\n    <span class=\"label\">意义：</span>葛雷制是美国进步主义教育运动中最卓越的例子，既有利于保持儿童的兴趣，也有着经济高效的管理方式\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"watermark\">\n  小红书：起风了的风景\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"title-line\">\n    <span class=\"red\">昆西教学法</span>\n    <span class=\"tag tag-tested\">考过简答</span>\n    <span class=\"handwritten-red\">口诀：含泪评价（含义、内容、评价）</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"note-box\">\n    <span class=\"sub-label\">一、含义：</span>昆西教学法由美国进步主义教育家帕克创办的一种教学方法。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"note-box\">\n    <span class=\"sub-label\">二、内容：</span><span class=\"annotation-blue\">（儿童中心重要，要联系创造）</span>\n    <ol>\n      <li>强调<span class=\"highlight-cyan\">儿童</span>应处于学校教育的<span class=\"highlight-cyan\">中心</span>。认为儿童具有内在的能力，能自发地学习。</li>\n      <li><span class=\"highlight-cyan\">重视学校</span>的社会功能。强调学校应成为理想的家庭、完善的社会和民主政治的雏形。</li>\n      <li><span class=\"highlight-cyan\">学校</span>课程与实际生活相联系。这样不仅可以唤起儿童学习的意愿，而且能摒弃无意义的形式训练。并把各门学科统一起来，获得整体知识。</li>\n      <li>强调<span class=\"highlight-cyan\">培养</span>儿童的自我探索和<span class=\"highlight-cyan\">创造</span>精神。帕克认为教师的作用是指导学生发现真理，使学生养成习惯来使用真理。</li>\n    </ol>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"note-box\">\n    <span class=\"sub-label\">三、评价：</span><span class=\"annotation-blue\">（调动儿童积极，忽视系统学习）</span>\n    <ol>\n      <li>昆西教学法有利于<span class=\"highlight-orange\">调动</span>儿童学习的<span class=\"highlight-orange\">积极性</span>和主动性，满足学生的兴趣与需要，使儿童成为学习的主人</li>\n      <li>昆西教学法过分强调儿童的个性，忽视教师的作用，<span class=\"highlight-purple\">忽略了系统知识的学习</span>，导致教学质量降低</li>\n    </ol>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"title-line\">\n    <span class=\"red\">昆西教学法</span>\n    <span class=\"tag tag-noun\">考过名词解释</span>\n    <span class=\"handwritten-red\">口诀：含泪评价（含义、内容、评价）</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"note-box\">\n    <span class=\"label\">含义：</span>昆西教学法由美国进步主义教育家帕克创办的一种教学方法。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"note-box\">\n    <span class=\"label\">内容：</span>强调儿童应处于学校教育的<span class=\"highlight-cyan\">中心</span>，<span class=\"highlight-cyan\">重视学校</span>的社会功能，强调学校应成为理想的家庭、完善的社会和民主政治的雏形；<span class=\"highlight-cyan\">学校</span>课程与实际生活相联系；强调<span class=\"highlight-cyan\">培养</span>儿童的自我探索和<span class=\"highlight-cyan\">创造</span>精神<span class=\"annotation-blue\">（儿童中心重要，要联系创造）</span>。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"note-box\">\n    <span class=\"label\">评价：</span>昆西教学法有利于<span class=\"highlight-orange\">调动</span>儿童学习的<span class=\"highlight-orange\">积极性</span>和主动性，但过分强调儿童的个性，<span class=\"highlight-purple\">忽略了系统知识的学习</span>，导致教学质量降低\n    <span class=\"annotation-blue\">（调动儿童积极，忽视系统学习）</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
